  "bodyHash": "sdPIYRox7u8=",
  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/easyshulkerboxes/banner.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\"></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/easyshulkerboxes/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center;line-height:36px\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252flunapixel.studio%252fdiscord\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Discord&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=discord&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"117\" height=\"28\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fx.com%252fFusseel\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Twitter&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=x&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"116\" height=\"28\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@heyitsfuzs\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=YouTube&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=youtube&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"118\" height=\"28\"></a> <a href=\"https://github.com/Fuzss\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=GitHub&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=github&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"108\" height=\"28\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/fuzs_\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=CurseForge&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=curseforge&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"143\" height=\"28\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fFuzs\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Modrinth&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=modrinth&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"129\" height=\"28\"></a></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/easyshulkerboxes/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/about.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\"></p><p><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Easy Shulker Boxes</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> 讓你能直接從物品欄中與界伏盒進行完整互動。放置物品、取出物品、瀏覽內容，以及管理儲存空間，完全無需將盒子放在地上。📦</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">受 Minecraft 現代束袋機制的啟發，此模組讓隨身儲存變得自然且直覺。捲動瀏覽已儲存的內容 🖱️，精確選擇您想要的物品 🎯，透過簡單點擊將物品移入或移出，使用滑鼠拖曳跨多個欄位傳送物品，或使用單一物品模式進行精準的物品欄管理。✨</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">除了原版界伏盒，此模組也支援終界箱，並可透過資料包擴展至其他模組的儲存物品。🔗</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">與簡單的提示框模組不同，這並非僅客戶端模組。它新增了真實的物品欄互動功能，必須同時安裝於客戶端與伺服器。如果您只想預覽界伏盒內容的提示框，請查看客戶端替代方案：</span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/shulkerboxtooltip\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Shulker Box Tooltip</span></a><span style=\"font-size:14px\">，由 </span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/misterpemodder\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">MisterPeModder</span></a><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> 製作。💡</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">也在使用束袋嗎？請查看 </span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/bundle-upgrade\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Bundle Upgrade</span></a><span style=\"font-size:14px\">，它能為 Minecraft 的束袋帶來相同的生活品質提升！🎒</span></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/easyshulkerboxes/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/features.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\"></p><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">📦 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">基於物品欄的儲存存取：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">直接從支援的儲存物品中放入和取出物品，無需將其放置在世界上。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🔍 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">詳細內容預覽：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">直接在物品提示框中查看已儲存的內容，讓您一眼就能看出每個儲存物品裡有什麼。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🎯 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">選擇任何已儲存物品：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">使用滾輪或鍵盤方向鍵來精確選擇您想互動的儲存物品，而不僅限於最近放入的那一個。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">📝 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">已選物品詳細資訊：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">瀏覽儲存內容時，立即查看目前所選物品的附加資訊。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">↔️ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">快速物品傳送：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">點擊物品到儲存物品上，或點擊儲存物品到物品欄欄位上，即可快速移動內容。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🖱️ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">跨多個欄位拖曳：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">點擊並拖曳橫跨物品欄欄位，以批次放入或取出物品，實現更快速的物品欄管理。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🎚️ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">精確物品移動：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">按住 </span><code><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Ctrl</span></code><span style=\"font-size:14px\">（Mac 上為 </span><code><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Command</span></code><span style=\"font-size:14px\">）來移動單個物品而非整組，精確控制傳送數量。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">📊 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">儲存填充指示器：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">可選地在支援的儲存物品上顯示束袋風格的填充條，以便一目瞭然地監控容量。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">💡 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">智慧相容性指示器：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">視覺提示顯示手持物品是否能被放入，以及內部是否已有相符物品。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">⚙️ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">高度可設定：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">自訂互動方式、控制項、提示框行為與視覺功能，以符合您的偏好遊戲風格。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🔗 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">資料包驅動相容性：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">可透過資料包新增對其他儲存物品的支援，實現與許多模組背包和儲存解決方案的整合。</span></li>\n</ul><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/easyshulkerboxes/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/media.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\"></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/easyshulkerboxes/media/1.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\"></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/easyshulkerboxes/media/2.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\"></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/easyshulkerboxes/media/3.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\"></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/easyshulkerboxes/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/installation.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\"></p><p><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">必須安裝於客戶端與伺服器</span></strong></p><p><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">需要安裝 </span></strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/puzzles-lib\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">PUZZLES LIB</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">（Fabric 與 NeoForge）</span></strong></p><p><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">需要安裝 </span></strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fabric-api\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">FABRIC API</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">（Fabric）</span></strong></p><p><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">需要安裝 </span></strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/forge-config-api-port-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">FORGE CONFIG API PORT</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">（Fabric）</span></strong></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/easyshulkerboxes/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/configuration.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\"></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">如果模組提供設定功能，您可以直接在遊戲中使用模組選單進行設定（在 Fabric 上需要安裝 </span><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fmodmenu\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Mod Menu</span></a><span style=\"font-size:14px\">，由 </span><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fProspector\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Prospector</span></a><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> 製作）。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">如需使用外部文字編輯器進行手動設定，所有檔案位於 </span><code><span style=\"font-size:14px\">.minecraft/config</span></code><span style=\"font-size:14px\">，根據設定類型命名為 </span><code><span style=\"font-size:14px\">MOD_ID-client.toml</span></code><span style=\"font-size:14px\">、</span><code><span style=\"font-size:14px\">MOD_ID-common.toml</span></code><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> 或 </span><code><span style=\"font-size:14px\">MOD_ID-server.toml</span></code><span style=\"font-size:14px\">。並非所有類型都會存在於某個模組中。</span></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/easyshulkerboxes/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/credits.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\"></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🌟 </span><span style=\"font-size:14px\">感謝 </span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/kir_antipov\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Kir_Antipov</span></a><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> 從其 </span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/packed-inventory\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Packed Inventory</span></a><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> 模組中啟發了終界箱功能。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🌟 </span><span style=\"font-size:14px\">非常感謝 </span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/mrniddala\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">MrNiddala</span></a><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> 啟發了透過在物品欄中拖曳物品來將物品放入或取出容器物品的功能。</span></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/easyshulkerboxes/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p><table style=\"text-align:center\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/nether-chested\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/netherchested/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n<td>  </td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/horse-expert\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/horseexpert/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/tiny-skeletons\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/tinyskeletons/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n<td>  </td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mindful-darkness\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/mindfuldarkness/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/armored-foes\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/armoredfoes/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n<td>  </td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/pixelshot\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/pixelshot/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/new-shroomcraft\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/shroomcraft/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n<td>  </td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/let-me-sleep\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/letmesleep/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/pick-up-notifier\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/pickupnotifier/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n<td>  </td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/effect-insights\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/effectinsights/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/easyshulkerboxes/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252flunapixel.studio%252fdiscord\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/studio.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\"></a></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/easyshulkerboxes/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p>",
